## The generation steps a `ProtoChunk` goes through.
## Port of pumpkin-world/src/generation/proto_chunk.rs; the chunk's data and accessors are protochunkbase.aowl,
## `TerrainCache` is generator/generator.aowl and `StandardChunkFluidLevelSampler` noise/aquifer_sampler.aowl.
##
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-world/src/generation/proto_chunk.rs - see structurehooks.aowl for what waits on
## generation/feature. generation/structure fills its hooks: importing structure/protostructures installs them.
## `spawn_structure_entities` and `spawn_mobs_for_chunk_generation` call through `WorldPortalExt`, as upstream does.

{.feature: "lenientnils".}

